  "How does the Mayo Clinic make its services more tangible to patients?\nA. By allowing patients to try out treatments before purchasing.\nB. By providing detailed brochures explaining medical procedures.\nC. By offering clear signals of care, competence, and trust through staff behavior, facility design, and social media.\nD. By lowering prices to attract more patients.\nC",
