  "Due in a large part to advances in technology, ________ is a major trend whereby product and service producers are bypassing intermediaries and going directly to final buyers, or radically new types of intermediary channels are emerging to displace traditional ones.\nA. The vertical marketing system\nB. The corporate marketing system\nC. Disintermediation\nD. The corporate merger\nC",
