  "Companies are increasingly moving away from high commission compensation plans because such plans often lead to salespeople ________\nA. undermining the work of the inside sales team\nB. ignoring management and marketing objectives\nC. being too pushy and harming customer relationships\nD. working multiple sales jobs to maximize their income\nC",
  "What is an organizational opportunity in SWOT analysis?\nA. An internal strength of the organization\nB. An internal weakness of the organization\nC. An area that increases the difficulty of an organization performing at a high level\nD. An area in the environment that, if exploited, may generate higher performance\nD",
  "The decision to use a cleaning genie to communicate the strength and power of Mr. Clean cleaning liquid is representative of the ________ process of the communication model.\nA. Sourcing\nB. Encoding\nC. Signifying\nD. Decoding\nB",
  "What is the main principle of consumer-oriented marketing?\nA. Focusing on the company's products and persuading customers to buy them\nB. Organizing marketing activities from the consumer's perspective to satisfy their needs\nC. Prioritizing short-term sales over long-term customer relationships\nD. Reducing marketing efforts to lower business costs\nB",
