  "What is the order of the main steps in designing the next customer value-driven strategy?\nA. Positioning, Market Segmentation, Differentiation, Targeting\nB. Market Segmentation, Targeting, Differentiation, Positioning\nC. Differentiation, Market Segmentation, Targeting, Positioning\nD. Positioning, Differentiation, Market Segmentation, Targeting\nB",
