  "Why is service perishability a challenge for service firms?\nA. Because services cannot be stored for later use, leading to lost value if demand fluctuates.\nB. Because service providers can always reschedule missed appointments.\nC. Because service businesses require fewer resources than product-based businesses.\nD. Because customers often return services if they are dissatisfied.\nA",
