  "Why do some marketers continue to use direct mail despite the rise of digital marketing?\nA. Because direct mail is the only way to reach older generations who don't use the internet\nB. Because direct mail provides a physical, memorable experience that digital marketing often lacks.\nC. Because direct mail is guaranteed to bypass spam filters and ad blockers.\nD. Because direct mail is the best way to get feedback from customers.\nB",
