  "According to the principle of innovative marketing, why should companies continuously seek product and marketing improvements?\nA. To reduce production costs and maximize short-term profits\nB. To avoid losing customers to competitors offering better solutions\nC. To comply with industry regulations and standards\nD. To simplify internal business processes\nB",
